xt":"LOTS 1 & 2 BLOCK A, LOT 1 BLOCK B, IN LADIES ADDITION No. 3, AND ALL ODD NUMBERED LOTS 759 THROUGH 809 ON TYLER STREET INCLUDING THE VACATED ALLEY ADJACENT THERETO, ODD NUMBERED LOTS 811-815 ON TYLER STREET INCLUDING VACATED STREETS AND ALLEYS ADJACENT THERETO, AND THE EAST 10 FEET OF EVEN NUMBERED LOTS 788 THROUGH 816 ON POLK STREET INCLUDING VACATED STREETS ADJACENT THERETO, ALL IN LADIES ADDITION, IN THE CITY OF TOPEKA, SHAWNEE COUNTY, KANSAS.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"f1548ca7-5df4-5634-9c22-323b2b052ab7"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"20667","citation_url":"https://files.topeka.gov/community/ordinances/2026/Ordinance20667.docx","content_hash":"29b76919dcdc485127c04fb1fb5afc3b17af00e2eed6d4a8b43bca47d60e97e4","heading":null,"ordinal":7,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:document","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:7","source_url":"https://files.topeka.gov/community/ordinances/2026/Ordinance20667.docx","text":"subject to:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"49c0d5ee-d4d5-5a5d-abe3-0826564cfa9d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"20667","citation_url":"https://files.topeka.gov/community/ordinances/2026/Ordinance20667.docx","content_hash":"f7b7b4db1fd38da4337c2d244a80b3cdaad093ec4d3b5a973fb7e91056f09069","heading":null,"ordinal":8,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:document","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:ordinances:ordinance:20667:block:8","source_url":"https://files.topeka.gov/community/ordinances/2026/Ordinance20667.docx","text":"1. Use and development of the site in accordance with the Laird Noller Planned Unit Development (PUD) Master Plan Amendment No. 1","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"9878dd2a-250b-5ee0-b96d-02d1a99202f7"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citatio